        "From Jelert’s spot on the deck, everything became a blur.",
        "Dusan was moving, drawing his sidesword, shoving Jelert toward cover as another streak of light hissed overhead. Jelert was still trying to identify the sounds that had caused Dusan’s spring-loaded reaction.",
