        "“They’re the mission: Burition rebels calling themselves the Alshien. They want to throw away the gifts of the empire.” He dropped the bloodied cloth into a passing soldier’s bucket. “Our orders are to help the Viceroy root them out and end these Alshien for good.”",
        "Jelert barely heard the explanation. His eyes had returned to Mirek’s body. The man had come to him for help, and he’d refused.",
